window.RVE=window.RVE||{};window.RVE["com.magoosh.flashcards.gre"]=[[3,"The app is really good. No doubt about that. The words repeat and that helps you remember them. However this feature of word repetition also prevents the users from revising words that they actually want to. My suggestion to the developer team is to introduce the feature of word selection, so that users can themselves select words that they actually want to revise, rather than merely showing up words repeatedly that they are already familiar with. Thanks!","2020-01",146,"repeat,+effect,+review"],[4,"It's a good app for improving vocabulary. But one thing that's very annoying is that we cannot look at all the words in a block at once. Just for revision purposes I think Devs should add this feature.","2021-06",82,"+effect,+wish"],[4,"I definitely recommend this app to anyone studying the GRE. Magoosh has painstakingly selected most tested words. we all know that English words can have multiple meaning which makes it hard for one to know which one to focus on, this has been taken care of. What more is that studying with the app will help you eliminate false mastery as you do not know the next word that will show up. you also get to keep learning or reviewing the ones you do not know until you have mastered it. I love this app particularly for providing contextual use of the words with instances that will actually help one to commit the words to memory. Magoosh also understood that test takers are always hard on themselves, so they throw in examples that will force that laugh out of your stern face. That said, i think one improvement which is , allowing users to go back and review words that they had difficulty learning after mastery, is highly needed. . For instance, i have mastered the first deck of 50words since last months, but l know there are words i want to look over again, but when i click on the deck, there's no way i could select those words that I want to see. Overall is a good app and 100% free","2019-07",69,"+review,+exam,+free,+wish"],[4,"The words with their respectful meaning are of great quality. The algorithm to train your mind and learn the words are also up to the mark. The only difficulty I experienced was when I try to get the pronunciation of a particular word it get's mute and this has happened to me a lot of times. I still don't knock how to make this right.","2020-12",55,"+listen"],[4,"Brilliant app! I find it extremely helpful for my prep. My mother loves it too though she already has a very strong vocab. It still helps her stay in touch with words that are not used that often in everyday speech. A few additional suggestions that would make the app a complete package - 1. Synonyms with tags that can lead us to that word and definition if clicked on. 2. Mnemonic definitions to help remember the words. 3. One overall repository where frequent weak words can get stored. Thanks!!","2020-07",53,"+effect"],[4,"Amazing application, really like the words and they way the level gets like \"Learning, Revising and Mastered\". One thing I found was words in Magoosh Vocabulary Builder (GRE section) are not in same order as in FCs, the advanced in VB was in common words here, so I had to switch to this app. The only scope of improvement which can make this application a power pack is, addition pictures or mnemonic along with sentences. If that is done, this app will rule any student's GRE prep.","2021-08",53,"+exam,+wish"],[4,"The app has a straight forward user interface. I like it overall and will continue to use it. I find myself looking up some of the words in webster's dictionary to learn more about words that share the same root. It's easier for me to remember a word when I know other words that are related to it. So I wish that some of the definitions were more in-depth within the app. Including synonyms would be nice too.","2021-11",51,"+effect,+wish"],[1,"Doesn't let me create an account, there's an error popping up that the password isn't correct. I don't have an account, so no question of password","2018-09",48,"bug,data"],[4,"This is a great app for learning GRE words hassel free. With this I'm able to learn up to 50 words a day. There's this one feature missing from the app that can have huge impact on learning process. You can't bookmark and make your own word list, So when you're reviewing mastered words, you have to go through all of them which takes a long time for each deck.","2021-09",44,"+review,+exam,+free"],[5,"Everything's good. just some suggestions to increase usability: 1. App should have a little pause before pronouncing, so the user can take the cellphone to his ear(from call speaker) also before the voice begins. 2. App should have the feature of showing the whole list of words from a deck once completed, so that we can find or revise something specific. 3. App should have a search option where we can search for any word and it opens its explanation and tells the deck that it belongs to.","2019-09",42,"+wish"],[5,"I'm still on the first stage, but this app tracks your progress like an AI, just be honest, if you forgot the definition or haven't mastered the word yet, just select 'I dont know this word', then the app will continue to drill the vocabulary to your brain. I loved this app from the first day of my GRE review.","2020-08",41,"+review,+exam"],[5,"Best method to learn GRE words. I find the approach used in the app very effective and unlike the approach other apps use. The app categorizes the words to three, learning, reviewing, and mastered. I have tried learning the words on my own without the app but this is by far better. Cons: I wish there was a way to see the list of words after mastering them. That would make reviewing them a lot easier.","2019-12",37,"+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[4,"Excellent. It's just that the fill in the blank activity has blanks that follow an \"a\" or an \"an\", narrowing down the potential answers. Changing the indefinite article to \"a(n)\" should fix this—or only listing words that share the quality of starting with either a vowel or a consonant sound.","2020-10",36,""],[5,"High-quality, useful app for prepping for the GRE Verbal section. One bug (as of Aug 2020): definitions/examples get cut off if they're too long. Also it would be nice if there was a list of all the words combined, or a way to manually select which words to review.","2020-08",34,"+review,+exam,+wish"],[1,"sign up option is full of bugs","2019-07",32,"bug"],[5,"Love these flashcards! A small request though: for the new feature of fill in the blank, can you guys make the sentence different from the one given when learning the words? I study the definition along with the example used in a sentence and the fill in the blank seems to come from these examples. Hope it's not too much!","2020-05",32,"+review,+exam"],[5,"This app has quality words which u will frequently find in newspapers, magazines etc. You won't have to go and look for the meaning of an obscure word amidst your reading if you go through all the words in app properly. Keep in mind that you are gonna learn words more than the words given in app as you will gradually become familiar with the synonyms and associate your learning with what you already know..It will widen your thought process and make your language more decorous and detailed..","2021-06",30,""],[5,"I have been using this app from a month and just today I can see few fill in the blank sections(Since I am new user,I don't know whether it's a new feature they recently added or an already existing one) and it was quite surprising and it's really useful for me.... And I am very happy with this app and I wish they add more fill in the blank sections.... Thank you Team Magoosh for creating this wonderful app.","2021-04",29,"+wish"],[2,"It would be better if all kinds of meanings were given, cause certain words have multiple meanings. And also For simple words like \"involved\" it is showing complicated meaning, while such meaning is rarely used in real world. And it would be better if I can see my mastered words in seperate section instead of resetting to visit them again.","2021-07",27,"data"],[3,"Though the method is very effective, I have felt that it ignores my prep and the progress that I made. For example, I finish off a Basic deck and master all words and see that 2-3 days later, it comes under a new deck when I just finished that like 2-3 days ago. Similar things happened for other decks.","2020-06",26,"+effect,+exam"],[4,"This app is really effective for learning words prevalent in gre. The only issue is, whenever I want to know the meaning of a particular word on my mind, I have to keep scrolling the flashcards. It would be great if all the words and their respective meanings are available in a list format.","2020-01",24,"+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[4,"My experience with this app has been excellent. My only concern with the app is that there is no way to see the words in each level in the form of a list, for quick revision.","2021-04",24,"+short"],[5,"Thanks to this and Barron's Verbal Workbook I have gotten a perfect Verbal Score on the GRE! Thank you! I found it most helpful to master every category completely and then at the end I created a new account so I could test myself from scratch. Otherwise it's hard to get all the words to have an equal chance of appearing again.","2018-09",23,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"The app definitely helps you improve your vocabulary. It teaches you new words and ensures that your revision is thorough by repeating it at regular intervals. It also has examples for better understanding. I highly recommend it!","2020-10",22,"+effect,+exam,+wish"],[3,"The app is really good and helps remember words well. Some of the problems I faced is that if you mark a word as known in a new list, that word will never come up again for revision. There should be a side feature where all words appear together. Another thing where I feel the app lacks is a Search Bar. It would be really amazing if we get a search bar to directly search a word in this and the flashcard pops up for it. Other than this, it's an amazing app. Would give 5 stars if this is done.","2023-06",20,"+effect,+review"],[5,"A list the size of 1000 is pretty solid for a start to preparing/training for GRE. The learn->review->master ladder is pretty sleek. It does really help enable building vocabulary kind of fun too. I am thoroughly enjoying the app. Great job! Few features I can think of for an update would be, to add to the existing list of words \"further study\" links to good dictionaries like Meriam Webster and allowing learners to add their personal lists separately with the content they find useful.","2019-08",19,"+review,+fun,+exam"],[3,"The app woukd be great if it wasnt for the bugs. Firstly, it logs me off everyday and when I login back all of the progress is gone. I thought maybe it's related to the fact I'm signing in through google so I tried to create an account with my email but I got unable to login pop up though the button clearly said 'Create account'","2023-07",18,"bug,data,ui"],[4,"Very nice app, the three levels of vocabulary mastery are an effective way to learn new words, and the often humorous example sentences help you build connections to the words that make it easier ro remeber them. One major problem though: There is no way to see all words in a deck, making it unnecessarily hard to revisit a fully mastered deck.","2019-08",18,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"This is the kind of app i wanted to learn english words from. I wanted an app which have chunking of words in the form of some categories. In this app words are categorized in basic, medium and advanced level. So, while revising it would be easier for me to know that how much part i have completed and how far i have to go by looking at the chunks left to study. Thanks Magoosh","2021-05",18,""],[4,"As good as the other reviews say. However, it sometimes shows words it's already covered as new, which raises a doubt whether really this app covers the said number of words in each section. Other than that, clean, effective, and easy to use!","2019-06",17,"+effect,+short,+review"],[4,"I absolutely recommend the content of this app for those who are about to take GRE, but to be honest the testing and UI of the app itself isn't that friendly and functional, I prefer to study these materials on something like Memrise or Anki which has lots to offer in case of options and games, BTW it has great study materials and I strongly recommend it for GRE takers","2019-10",17,"+fun,+exam"],[5,"It's a clean flashcard app, no garbage ads, and I like the amount of review they give in terms of: if you say you don't know a term, how they go about pounding it into your head through resurfacing the card in the deck.","2020-01",16,"+review"],[3,"Great app. Words have been divided into meaningful brackets. In my opinion. 1. Flashcard must include antonym of the word along with meaning and sentence. 2. No need to advertise in the excercise. For example - Asking the meaning of Magoosh. Just to say it is a GRE training webapp","2020-09",15,"ad,+review,+exam"],[4,"Wonderful learning experience till now. Though i feel that the included option of going backward for reviewing the flashcards would be nice. Otherwise, you will have to keep tapping till you find that card. Also its good to have a skip button for words that you already know. Thank you!","2019-10",15,"+review,+wish"],[1,"The app updated and all my progress got lost. Now it loses progress every time i leave the app. It is unusable. Why would you add a feature that does not work? How hard is it to do one test before you deploy it to google play? You ruined a perfect app.","2023-08",13,""],[4,"Reset all Decks functionality doesn't work, I have completed about half of all the flash cards and now I cannot seem to reset the decks. Is there a limit to the amount of times we can reset the decks? If yes, it needs to be explicitly specified. Edit :- Thank you for the prompt reply. I had an Android software update pending. After updating, the reset decks issue got solved. Will update this space if any other grievance arises","2020-03",13,""],[3,"Pros: it's free, flashcards are divided into sets, and the pronunciation is provided. Cons: I cannot fathom how people can like the way flashcards are randomly shown. It makes me practice several times words that I know VERY well. My advice is to mark all the words as known and make flashcards of the ones you don't know or you'll waste time. I've also bought Kaplan's and Manhattan's flashcards. The words on this list are truly relevant for the GRE.","2019-10",12,"voice,+review,+listen,+exam,+free"],[4,"Although the app is useful enough...i would still suggest some overhauling that is...flashcards must not repeat themselves recurrently.... I mean all flashcards should be given equal chances and not just be displayed randomly recurrent and and must keep a record and the app should engender the quantity of cards too","2020-09",12,"+review"],[1,"This app has the worst bug. I open the app and ALL of my progress is gone. Every word I studied and reviewed is gone when I repopen the app. I've had to resign in over 3 times and still nothings changed. Terrible feeling, don't download until the massive bug is fixed.","2023-08",11,"bug,data"],[5,"This app is something extremely terrific to practice vocabulary regularly.Words are catagorised into different levels based on difficulty. So, when I've time I just open it and prepare myself getting into GRE words in a very efficient way.Much recommended app for GRE vocabulary hunters!","2020-12",11,"+exam"],[5,"I love it. But these is an issue. when someone practiced one set of 51 words, they can not be accessed individually. so please fix. and There should audio facility which will help too and strengthen the vocabulary improvement. because auditory learn is part of learning. Thank you Chris. you rock man. And thanks to all Magoosh team.","2020-05",11,"+listen,+wish"],[1,"This app could be revolutionary to learn new words and memorize them. The rich collection of words and the classification have made the difference. But, unfortunately the bug issues has subdued the likelihood. Everytime I open the app it requires sign in and the progress disappears. It really kills our time. Kindly fix it.","2023-09",10,"bug,data"],[1,"I want to report a bug. I'm using OnePlus Nord CE 2 and whenever I close the app and clear it from app history, it automatically logs me off from my account (with gmail) and ask for login again. Worse part is, all my progress is not getting stored, hence I need to start from the last save after logging in","2023-07",10,"bug,data"],[5,"I'm in love with this app. It not only enriches your vocabulary but also tells u about its usage and makes u practice the word so much that it gets etched in your mind easily. A great app for preparation of all exams.","2021-07",10,"+exam"],[5,"This is an amazing must have app for any trying to improve their vocabulary for stanrdised exams like GRE and GMAT. I recommend this. This app makes sure that you memorise any particular word in the best way possible.","2021-09",10,"+exam,+wish"],[2,"Cannot able to login neither with Facebook nor with Gmail. Kindly rectify it","2019-11",9,"data"],[4,"What about having access to the full list of a given vocabulary deck level, instead of randomizing word as sometimes words are repeating for the learning purposes while i want full access to all the words in a given list.","2020-01",9,""],[4,"Really good app, but i would love to see the following: 1. For each section be able to see a list of all the words in it. 2. Include an option to swipe right and left for yes and no. 3. Include the phonetic transcription of the words.","2021-07",9,""],[5,"Highly engaging way to learn new words quickly. I learnt over 100 new words in 2 days. The app shows you a random sequence of flashcards each containing a different word. On the click of a button, it reveals the meaning of the word along with a sample usage in a sentence. You can then categorise the word as known or unknown and accordingly the word will be repeated in the sequence just as many times as needed for you to master it. Great strategy, quite addicting","2024-12",9,"+short,+review,+fun"],[5,"This app was really great,as it helped me prep for the test on the go. I could prepare with it anywhere, anytime. It also was very rigorous as it made sure that the words that I had forgotten or understood wrongly were corrected and remembered. The flashcards are an excellent technique for remembering a lot of stuff easily. Hats off, Magoosh for an excellent app.","2019-01",9,"+effect,+review,+exam"],[5,"Since I downloaded this app my vocabulary ad grown so much. I just love this app I can open it on my down time or when I'm traveling to and from work. I love how it have the sound button for when I'm unsure how to say a word she teaches me the proper pronunciation.","2021-10",9,"+listen"],[2,"It's handy, but if it provided the chance to review based on Litner principles, I would rank it 5. I can't analyse my learning process. That would be great if I could enter the words into Memrise or Anki :/","2019-07",8,"wish"],[3,"The app is great and the vocabulary included is quite useful. But the way each word described is not good, there should be a little more explanation for the words like an example or an image to remember perhaps and must have include synonyms for each word.Despite the above rest is good. The above changes might help remeber the words very easily.","2019-03",8,"+effect,+exam"],[3,"Good but not great, can't flip card back over after you see the explanation. This is extremely frustrating because you have no choice but to move on to the next card. Harder to commit things to memory IMHO.","2021-11",8,""],[5,"Great app! It gives you the convenience to learn new words and also master the words by repeating the words learnt. Having used it for only some few days, i'm impressed by the progress with my vocabulary build up. What i will appreciate is a test to assess the words learnt after each session.","2019-12",8,"+exam"],[1,"The app has turned awful after this 2023 update. I get automatically logged out time and again. My progress is not synced. Also the app worked offline before the update.","2023-07",7,"data"],[5,"it's a wonderful app. I prefer to all who are doing preparation of GRE. it is useful app..vocabulary with proper meaning and sentence as well. I more think I would recommend to add that is pronunciation of words because some words are difficult to pronounce correctly..otherwise the app is worth of appreciation.","2019-04",7,"+listen,+exam"],[1,"Vocabs are pretty usefull but here are some issues : 1) we cant just see the meaning of word. I mean there should be option where we can just search and view vocabs. 2) example used are too lenghty and are much difficult. Example should be simple and short. 3) some meaning are not properly understandable for non native english speaker. It can be simpler but you cant add any of your word there. i mean i have to look for dictonary for meaning of word too 4) Too Much rigid not flexible.","2024-01",6,""],[1,"the app is not working for me, it doesnt show me the words which i have to learn.. plz fix the problem asap","2016-03",6,"bug"],[3,"Please consider this edit: Once I have mastered a deck, the words must not repeat during a review. 😑 It takes more time when words repeat. Also, after revising a deck of 51 words for 10 minutes, I am not sure if all the words came!! But it wouldn't take me 5 mins to review all 51 mastered words if the words didn't repeat. I recon that repeating is necessary, but make it repeat only after I completed and am sure of my 51 words review (you can randomize the words though as you wish).","2023-08",6,"repeat,wish,+short,+review,+wish"],[3,"I created an account on my computer but the app is not allowing me to login or create a new account. The error message is \"sorry, the password isn't right for your account\". And it's not allowing to create a new account too Meanwhile I'm able to use same details to login on the computer.","2020-05",6,"bug,data"],[5,"Great, super user-friendly. I would add an option where the words of each section can be reviewed as a list. Ranked from the one we struggled the most to remember to the easy ones. So that in a glimpse we know in which section which words to work on. But still the app deserves 5stars.","2018-10",6,"+effect,+short,+review"],[5,"It is a very good application for those who are busy throughout the day. It helps you learn words and repeat it until necessary. One thing is that the review system is not an multiple choice question or fill in the blanks type. It would have been much better.","2019-08",6,"+effect,+review"],[5,"The flashcards are beautiful. Also, though it took a long time for me to finish one flashcard, i find that it appears i have consequently gotten a good hang of the words. I also like the tests. Well done to the developers of the app.","2021-11",6,"+review,+exam"],[2,"I love this app but I just updated it and it isn't saving the words I've mastered. I'll come back to a deck I haven't finished yet and it will say I have 20 new words even though I've mastered half and was reviewing the other half. It's getting to be very annoying. It feels like I can't finish a deck since it keeps resetting half my progress.","2024-01",5,"data,ui"],[3,"The flash cards are not syncing properly to my account. I already completed basic 2 but after syncing manually it reverts back and shows that I haven't even started","2020-05",5,"data"],[4,"It would be great if you could add \"Fill in the blanks\" card for Basic and Advance words also. They are extremely helpful in increasing familiarity with the words and learn its usage.","2021-07",5,"+effect,+wish"],[4,"Its a good app i really like it. Except when you go back to the main screen from the vocabs or close the app, it doesnt save all the vocabs ive reviewed and i have to redo many of them again. It may be a minor bug but it is annoying.","2023-10",5,"+review"],[4,"The app is very good. Helped me a lot to learn new words fast. Thanks magoosh! It'd have been better if I could search for a word that comes to my mind - that I don't remember the meaning for. 😊 great app, nonetheless.","2019-06",5,"+effect"],[5,"What can I say about this app that has not already been said. It is one of a kind app that helps you to strengthen your vocabulary and probably the only one for free. Thank you Magoosh for providing yet another amazing arsenal to tame the beast that is verbal of GRE.","2020-04",5,"+effect,+exam,+free"],[1,"Don't update it. I did it and now it doesn't work well. It doesn't sync your study records like before and also every time that I open the app I have to login to my account again ...","2023-07",4,"bug,data"],[1,"Every app and website requires an account to use and frankly, I'm over it. Had to create an account just to use flash cards, so i don't need this app, I'll find a different one.","2018-03",4,"data"],[2,"Needs some improvement. The same word keeps repeating annoyingly which makes the app very difficult to work with.There should be a simple list of words for the user to navigate through while reviewing.","2020-04",4,"repeat,ui,wish"],[3,"Suggestion:Would be good if we were able to star/mark the words that we find difficult and view them later(in the form of a list/flashcard). The app should also have the facility to view all the words listwise(common,basic,etc); this would make revision of older lists much easier.","2018-12",4,"+review"],[3,"So this app is definitely helpful but I'm saddened that they don't let take the reins in anyway. A big thing I find annoying is Id like to go back to find specific words I struggle with but you can't do this on the app.","2021-10",4,"ui,+effect"],[3,"The app content is really good but it keeps logging out and resetting the cards. I have to go to settings login and sync cards each time I open the app. Please fix this bug.","2023-07",4,"bug,data,wish"],[4,"The thing lacking is a custom deck. Like a deck containing words from the decks chosen by the user. Lets say i am revising deck 1 to 3 so now i had to go deck by deck and since words are unique so i know since its deck number 2 chortle means laughing merrily. But in real case i wont be able to do it. So kindly add an option of custom deck","2019-08",4,"+custom"],[4,"This is a very useful app. Does what it is intended to do without showing any ads. One can concentrate on learning without having to watch unwanted advertisements.","2021-12",4,""],[5,"Really good apps and very user friendly. I love how the flash cards are sequenced such that you have a mastery of every word in a deck of cards. It could be made better by adding synonyms to the word meanings. I really like the app.","2019-09",4,""],[5,"Very helpful, with sentences and a history of how many words have been mastered, reviewed or still being learned. However the sentences are longer and could be made shorter to be helpful.","2021-06",4,"+effect,+short,+review"],[5,"This app is great for reviewing words while studying for a verbal oriented aptitude test that demands testtakers to have a high level vocabulary. This app in conjunction with the Magoosh Vocabulary Builder aids in preparation for a multitude of tests. I would definitely recommend this app to all of my friends since it is very rare that a free service can be this beneficial, app works as advertised and you can use it offline as well.","2019-02",4,"+review,+exam,+free"],[5,"Truly a very beautiful app. Keeps me engaged and hooked onto reading more and more words. And the system it uses to give you practice is very efficient.","2021-05",4,""],[2,"Removing a star every time I see \"Magoosh\" as something to memorize. I find it deeply disruptive to my learning.","2020-02",3,""],[3,"A very helpful learning tool, but my progress was not synchronized by the app, twice. Very much disappointed. Will uninstall.","2020-05",3,"data,+effect"],[4,"Pretty exhaustive collection of words and rightly segregated. Randomised repetition of words helped with learning. Quizzing for general words is a great service. Could've been better if it was provided for difficult words as well.","2020-09",3,"+effect,+review"],[5,"this Flashcard is pretty good. easy to use. it is boring to memorize words. If Magoosh can create an applicationon which multiple students can play game or compete for memorizing the word, it would be perfect. But anyway, I still love current version of flash card.","2019-07",3,"+effect,+short,+review,+fun"],[5,"Here is Malik Haroon from Pakistan. I am preparing currently for Compatitive Exams and trust me guys. These Magoosh apps are really helpful for me. As it becomes easier for me to remember difficult words. By doing little bit daily thorough exercises in Magoosh,helps alot to increase my vocabulary, leaving behind old conventional means of remembering words. If you guys are preparing for school, college or any any kind of competitive exams then these have must have a place in your phone.","2022-02",3,"+effect,+fun,+exam,+habit"],[5,"Best set of 1000 words. Even people not preparing for GRE will find the common and basic word sets very useful. Feedback: Should have option to 1) view all the words in a set at a glance. 2) reset particular set 3) make custom sets using our own words. And then practice them.","2019-11",3,"+exam,+custom,+wish"],[5,"The flashcards in this app have really helped my vocabulary and use of English words. I'm very happy plus the app is free to use and cost absolutely nothing at all....making it definitely the best for me.","2020-11",3,"+effect,+review,+free"],[5,"I have had no issues with this app, the only suggestion I would have is for the ability to reset your progress on a word deck. Overall, it's great for learning some new vocabulary.","2021-08",3,""],[1,"The app is OK, but the height of the card is less than the number of text lines. I can't see the whole example sentence for most words even though there is a lot of space at the bottom of the page. I would give a 5 star rating if you could sort it out","2022-05",2,""],[1,"The progress I make towards each flash card deck dissappears after a few days and can't be found.. Is this normal?? It's so annoying and inconvenient.","2020-07",2,"ui"],[1,"words repetion is disturdingly frequent, literally a messy at , total time wastage","2019-01",2,""],[1,"Not able to reset the deck. Its saying Resetting... Other than this everything is fantastic. Its a very good app.","2018-08",2,"data"],[1,"Great app but 5 stars only when it supports offline reading mode. Not everyone has internet everywhere :(","2014-07",2,""],[2,"The flashcards are great, but most of my progress is regularly lost every two weeks or so. I can't afford to use such a fidgety app.","2020-05",2,""],[2,"I've memorised almost 700 words and evrytime I come back and refresh the first level only 3 words keep repeating, is this part of the app?","2016-02",2,"repeat"],[2,"Can u add an option for revising previous word","2015-03",2,""],[4,"Amazing ad free large set of vocab flashcards. It tailors your experience by making you re-answer flashcard definitions that you missed in the past. My only request for the magoosh team is that there be maybe two sentence examples with each word so users could get a better idea of what real-world use is like","2020-09",2,"+review,+exam,+free"],[5,"I love how this app helped me master new words and recall the ones I knew. I suggest the app to offer a place for the learners to write examples and maybe share them. In this way, we are more likely to remember the word in a more intimate way.","2026-05",2,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"I have been using this app for about a week now and have thoroughly enjoyed it. The quality of the app is much higher than similar apps that I have used. I am keen on the fact that it uses the terms in sentences for a deeper understanding of how they are utilized in context, which I have not found in other apps. The app is organized into \"flashcards\" that include 50 words per deck and really focus on the mastery of each term.","2021-11",2,"+review,+fun"],[5,"I love this app! I was able to learn over 200 words in two days. The definitions are straight to the point and examples help them stick faster. I suggest that one with the whole 5000 GRE words be created. Mastering 1000 words is not enough to get ready for the GRE.","2019-02",2,"+exam"],[5,"I really like the app and how its makes you keep reviewing words until you really have them down. The only thing I would add, if possible, is a few different example sentances and quiz which gave you answer choices. It reall is a great app!","2019-04",2,"+review,+exam"],[5,"I have been using this didactic app for 4 days now. For those who usually are not amenable, I can tell you that this one is definitely working. After a preliminary assessment, I understood that my vocabulary was definitely wanting. I discovered this app fortuitously (pure luck) and since then, I have been able to master at least 200 words so far. This app uses learning techniques that are different from those involved tutorials on Youtube, which I really lambast for making our life harder. LOOL","2022-06",2,""],[5,"It's a very great app..!! But a few suggestions, it's better to have search Option to locate preferred word directly ,, Provide two or more usage sentences for better understanding of the word","2019-12",2,""],[5,"It's a great app to use to improve your vocab while you are on the move. Vocab is such an essential part of the Verbal section. So I would highly recommend using this app to improve your vocab!","2021-10",2,"+wish"],[5,"A really helpful app. As far as future updates are concerned, it would be amazing if you could enable the user to reset individual flash card sets.","2019-08",2,"+effect"],[5,"One of the best apps for GRE vocabulary. Easy interface and well programmed to help one master those words. I highly recommend this app for anyone wishing to write. GRE","2021-09",2,"+short,+exam"],[5,"This is a great place to study vocabulary fast. If possible adding feature that we can mark some words and making flashcards with them would be really great.","2021-04",2,"+review"],[1,"Don't see a reason why such a simple app whose purpose is straightforward should refresh each and every time we go back from a flash set. And worse yet, we lose most of the progress and have to do it all again. What are you guys syncing? Why does it take so long..it's a dictionary, for gods sake..damn","2023-11",1,"data"],[1,"App is good itself but words are outdated, GRE no longer has the words that are in this flashcards. I learned all words from these flashcards and barely any of them were useful in actual GRE exam.","2022-11",1,""],[1,"Why some words we cant hear how they're prononuced, or be able to put more than 5 words as i didnt know if u had mastered before.. kindly fix this.. it takes 2 hours to go through all words of a set... and you believe they're done when you the truth is you missed out on some because they never show up... please fix","2020-01",1,"wish"],[1,"previously after tapping on a flashcard it used to flip but now it takes 2-3, even 4, taps to flip the same flashcard. Please fix this bug.","2025-08",1,"bug,wish"],[1,"i can't create an account. It keeps showing wrong password when I'm just creating a new account.","2019-04",1,"data"],[1,"Add a bookmark or save option to return back to words I find difficult to remember.","2020-03",1,""],[1,"The reset button simply refuses to work. Other than that great app.","2018-10",1,"data,ui"],[1,"Even after signing in removes all performance data after few days","2020-05",1,"data"],[1,"All my progress was undone automatically.","2020-06",1,""],[1,"None of the definitions appear","2017-10",1,""],[2,"Flashcards reset for no apparent reason (ie, I'll master 15 words and only 7 will show mastered next time I use the app).","2020-05",1,"data"],[2,"Unable to reset flashcards. That feature seems to be completely broken","2019-09",1,"bug,data"],[2,"I'm not able to reset my deck. It's full of bugs.","2019-09",1,"bug,data"],[2,"The data doesn't get saved","2023-08",1,""],[2,"Please add a search box to find words.","2019-01",1,"wish"],[2,"Functional app with decent list of words (though a little easier than I'd like), but I've noticed that some of the definitions are blatantly wrong. Jaundice = bias? Dogmatic = opinionated?","2017-12",1,""],[2,"1) Resetting a single deck is missing. 2) once mastered almost impossible to go through everything again because of worst random logic which keeps repeating few words instead of going through all of them.","2015-03",1,"data,lack,repeat"],[3,"After installing the app there's popping up a server error in the creation of new account. Everytime I enter the email and password. The server error pops up. I can't just create an account due to this problem. Please try to solve it as soon as possible.","2022-12",1,"bug,data"],[3,"Audio is pretty bad for some reason. It loads very slowly and the quality is not good enough. Also it does have problems with synchronisation, you're progess does not save often, when you log in. Words are pretty good, though.","2024-01",1,"bug,data,+listen"],[3,"App works great, but in general, I am not happy with the flashcards' ordering, i.e. when reviewing, if you don't know one word, next 5 out of 10 cards are gonna be THAT word. It's very repetitive.","2019-10",1,"repeat,+review"],[3,"I have logged in with my email id but I'm losing my progress. Every week, the deck seems to be refreshed","2020-06",1,""],[4,"The app is great for memorizing the words. My one complain is that the cards don't instantly turn when you press them it turns on second or 3rd press. Gets very annoying during review. Also please add an option to turn a Mastered word to Learning. If you misclick once might as well say good bye to that word.","2026-09",1,"+effect,+review,+wish"],[4,"I wish there was a back button to just go right back to the card previously bc sometimes I accidentally hit the wrong thing! Also it would be nice if I could reset individual decks instead of all/none. Other than that, a very simple and not bad app.","2022-10",1,"+short,+wish"],[4,"It's a good app and handy as you can learn from it, even while travelling as it is in your phone...i just incurred one problem that it can't reset the decks after sometime..i don't know why that happens, so i have to reinstall it at that time.","2019-08",1,""],[4,"Awesome app to go through vocab.. Only one suggestion - add option to clear a particular deck of cards and allow to replay them again, instead of clearing all 1000 words.. Other than this it is far better than any other flash card app..","2018-12",1,""],[4,"Amazing app! However it would be really helpful if you could introduce a feature by wish I can add certain flashcards from the lists to a personalized list so that all the words that I find difficult are in one place","2020-06",1,"+effect,+review,+wish"],[4,"One suggestion for the fillin the blanks cards: in case of a incorrect answer, the flashcard should also show the meaning of the chosen incorrect option. This way we can know why the chosen option was incorrect.","2023-09",1,"+review"],[4,"This app can be very useful for preparing for GRE but more than that its playfulness makes learning enjoyable. The app ensures that you learn the word by repeatedly asking you the same till you have mastered it.","2018-09",1,"+fun,+exam"],[4,"It's a great app to learn new words however I would suggest that newer sentences be used in the fill in the blanks sections so that a better understanding of the word is attained.","2020-08",1,""],[4,"Very good app for vocabulary building. Randomization of words make the users not memorize the words by position, rather helps to conceive the meaning. UI can get better.","2019-05",1,"+effect"],[4,"Good. Only problem found : undo progress, sync are buggy. Your progress is messed up if you sync or undo progress. Can undo without resetting progress.","2020-12",1,""],[4,"It's lacking a few key things, like maybe able to bookmark some cards and review them? Or be able to sift through the 'learning' words","2019-09",1,"+review"],[4,"So far it's great! Wish it had a testing option though where it would mix the words and definitions up to actually test your knowledge but i use this daily to study random words for the GRE I want to take soon. 😊","2019-08",1,"+exam,+habit,+wish"],[4,"The app is well designed. I would like to put forth a suggestion. If the Magoosh team could categorise flashcards with respect to similar and tangible words and also to denotation and connotation.","2020-04",1,"+review"],[4,"I liked the app but if mnemonics could be added along with the meanings it would make learning words easier.","2018-10",1,""],[5,"I am bound to give this app ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ rating for its wonderful purpose for all GRE aspirants. But since the latest update, which has creeped, made it seem very rankling to aspirants as they don't get their progress into account. I would like to request that there is a bug in the latest update, and please try to fix it as quickly as possible as we are in peak season of giving GRE exam (July-Sept). Hope this will surely fix the bug!","2023-08",1,"+short,+exam"],[5,"I can't believe this app is free! I've learned hundreds of new words and I love the sentences to help see how the word can be used in a sentence. The one way it can be improved would be for a list of synonyms/antonyms that are high yield on the GRE as well.","2019-07",1,"+effect,+exam,+free,+wish"],[5,"It's fun while you learn. Beautifully designed flash cards that you can read anywhere anytime..even at work or in meeting..while watching tv or even on ride. It gives you an opportunity to learn vocab in the most exciting way.","2020-01",1,"+fun"],[5,"This app is easy to use, gives me the option to practice quickly when I have moment. I use it consistently throughout the day. I'm completely satisfied with the variety of vocabulary and options for studying.","2020-12",1,"+short,+habit"],[5,"Great app. Better than the usual flash cards because you can just use it on your mobile. It's also add free. However, adding synonyms and antonyms should be considered.","2023-12",1,"+free"],[5,"Awesome app. Got referred to it by a fellow who coached me for my GRE. Almost all the vocab came from these decks in my verbal sections. A great word list. My advice is, do all the decks thoroughly for a great score in verbal.","2019-02",1,"+exam"],[5,"Excellent flash cards. I love the fact that the words you're 'learning' show up randomly, because it helps to review them and imprint into longer-term memory.","2018-09",1,"+effect,+review"],[5,"This application brims with diverse and recondite vocab. I was genuinely dumbfounded by many of the words. Although I myself possess a tapestry of arcane expressions, traversing this lexical landscape left me feeling unexpectedly cornered —realizing that I was unacquainted with nearly fifty percent of the words the application has to offer. That realization, far from discouraging me, filled me with admiration","2026-01",1,""],[5,"Very helpful, straightforward flashcard app that does an excellent job teaching many of the vocab words that the GRE will throw at you. You can't beat it for a free prep tool.","2020-05",1,"+effect,+review,+exam,+free"],[5,"Wonderful Learning experience. would be nice if the transcription of words can be put underneath the word itself. dont always like listening to audio and consuming more data","2019-04",1,"+listen,+wish"],[5,"This app taught me a lot of words that I otherwise would not have been able to understand during the actual GRE. I got into my graduate programs of choice, so no complaints here!","2020-08",1,"+exam"],[5,"A great app to improve your vocabulary! I recommend it to all. However, I would like to suggest that there should be a search button, so that one can easily go to a particular word directly.","2020-09",1,"+wish"],[5,"Great app although not convenient as the solid flashcards. A good way to learn and remember most of the words and their meanings.","2021-02",1,"+effect,+short,+review"],[5,"I used this app for one month and learnt all the words religiously. I gave my GRE and scored 159 in verbal. It was due to this app that my score improved from 150 to 159, resulting in me getting 324. Thanks to GRE Flashcards. Highly recommended. :)","2020-01",1,"+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Good vocabulary app. In addition to the flashcards, a feature that lists all the words in a particular set (such as Common Words V) alphabetically will be very helpful to learners. I'll be happy if Magoosh takes care of this.","2020-09",1,"+effect,+review"],[5,"This app helped me study GRE vocab and some of the words actually showed up! I had so much fun learning vocab that I kept the app and do it just for fun sometimes now.","2018-11",1,"+effect,+fun,+exam"],[5,"Very great. It has helped furnish my wanting vocabulary. Not just to learn, but also help review the words you've learnt so that you master them.","2020-06",1,"+effect,+review"],[5,"Loved the app. But it would be more helpful if the flashcards also viewed the available synonyms (from the already mastered ones) with each new word.","2019-03",1,"+effect,+review"],[5,"Very easy to learn and revise new words in this format. Helpful meanings and examples. Very useful app!","2018-11",1,"+effect,+short,+exam"],[5,"**Reset button at the deck level** Hey Magoosh Team, Thanks for this amazing app that really helps in imbibing the words. Just a request, please provide a *Reset button at the deck level* along with complete Reset that is already present. I am sure that would be a great help for most of us to have a Reset button at deck level.","2020-11",1,"+effect"],[5,"Very helpful in learning vocab for the GRE. Simple, easy to use interface and lets you study on the go.","2019-06",1,"+effect,+short,+exam"],[1,"Keeps logging out automatically, doesn't save progress anymore. It used to be a nice app but they had to ruin it.","2023-08",0,""],[1,"Progress is lost and not synced. Also account details are not synced.","2023-08",0,"data"],[1,"Each time I out from the app I logged out automatically and my progress shows zero whenever I logged in back.","2023-08",0,""],[1,"Is this a glitch in app? I can't see full sentences, just first two lines. Extremely horrible","2020-08",0,"bug"],[1,"The progress disappeared quickly, and I had to pick up from the beginning.","2024-09",0,""],[1,"Difficult to learn.. Alot of sentences and one could be irritate by the difficulty of this app.","2024-01",0,""],[1,"Stuck on loading animation after entering username and password. Internet is functional.","2021-04",0,"bug"],[1,"Installed. Been 15 mins, doesn't even load. Used on Android 14 with ISP bandwidth of 250 MBPS.","2023-01",0,""],[1,"Uninstalled immediately when I saw the word \"Magoosh\" appeared in the word list.","2021-06",0,""],[1,"there should be bookmark option, so that i can access all those words which i bookmarked...","2020-05",0,""],[1,"Not able to reset the cards","2020-07",0,"data"],[1,"Reset all decks button doesn't work","2020-08",0,"bug,data,ui"],[1,"The reset function doesn't work.","2021-10",0,"bug,data"],[1,"There must be a search functionality in the app.","2020-09",0,""],[1,"I need to google additionally for the meaning of the word used by you to describe the meaning of some other word.","2019-11",0,""],[1,"What's the point of login if all my progress is anyway going to vanish the next day?!","2023-08",0,"data"],[1,"Best app! Hoping to get 341","2025-09",0,""],[1,"Server Error: doesn't let me create account.","2020-09",0,"bug,data"],[1,"Idk for me it never loads any damn flashcards.","2022-05",0,""],[1,"Fabulous & outstanding.","2019-05",0,""],[1,"why do you need access to my media?","2019-03",0,""],[1,"Awful customer service.","2022-05",0,"cs"],[1,"Great way to kick start my day","2021-05",0,""],[1,"First word I saw had wrong meaning.","2021-08",0,""],[1,"it is very good app.","2021-03",0,""],[1,"Doesn't let me create account","2021-12",0,"data"],[1,"BORING, test me first, then review","2021-06",0,"repeat"],[1,"App is stuck in the loading screen, buffering infinitely, worked only for the first day.","2018-02",0,"bug"],[1,"Noob update. Unable to select words and search for meanings any more. Please add back. In addition, can't reverse when mistakenly tap 'I knew this word' but I mean to tap 'I didn't know'.","2017-12",0,"wrong,wish"],[1,"Magoosh PLEASE TAKE NOTE- After the New update, there is some bug in the app. Whenever i press the flashcard it just disappears . pls rectify this problem ASAP","2017-10",0,"bug"],[1,"Copy service isnt working, worst service i found..","2017-10",0,""],[1,"- For reasons unknown no option to reset certain decks, only ALL decks...why? The developer never thought about that that's something people possibly want? If so, please look for another job, because you suck! - no pronunciation / sound - Algorithm sucks - no indication in the flashcards to which meaning they are looking for (e.g. adj/noun/verb with same spelling) - no way to review a deck as a list, only randomly possible + good words......main problem is that this COULD be an awesome app, developers just CHOOSE not to make it one!","2018-03",0,"data,voice"],[1,"Um, why does the update need access to my calls now? What data am I giving away in exchange for studying some vocabulary words? This seems suspicious. I'm out.","2017-12",0,""],[1,"Needs a list feature. If you want to review old mastered decks each deck will only show the same 10 words over and over instead of all 50","2017-10",0,""],[1,"I tried to create account and it's says this is not a right password for you. I don't understand what that mean. I tried to do a forgot password and never received a email with reset link","2017-05",0,"data"],[1,"Device ID and call information and permission to draw over other apps? Seriously? What the hell is wrong with you guys? You just became a malware.","2017-10",0,"lock"],[1,"Help.. I am trying to create account,but it is frequently showing me same error .(Cannot connect to server)","2017-02",0,"bug,data"],[1,"Several of the meanings are inaccurate. I don't know why they simply don't show the dictionary meanings","2016-10",0,"wrong"],[1,"The material is GREat, but, the app has a few smoothness issues.","2017-05",0,""],[1,"Cheater,,, Fraud,,, Why you have to access my call information and device id??? Why you have to access in my file information...","2017-10",0,""],[1,"Why do you need device ID and call data?","2018-02",0,""],[1,"Not able to create account.Fix this bug.It says Sorry this isn't right password for account","2016-06",0,"bug,data"],[1,"While practising completed decks the app repeatedly shows only 2-3 cards.","2016-03",0,"repeat"],[1,"Same words appear again and again","2016-03",0,"repeat"],[1,"When I tried to sync with my web account, the program qualified all my decks as mastered. When I tried to reset all my decks, the program said it couldn't reach the server. I can't review mastered words. Please help!","2015-05",0,"data"],[1,"They've added their name also in wordlist. Keeping on coming. Shouldve added in Oxford... Lol","2015-11",0,""],[1,"All the apps force close on my Galaxy Grand Duos so I'm unable to use every single one of them","2015-09",0,""],[1,"Can't see anything ... loading issues.","2015-12",0,"bug"],[1,"Can't reset the flashcards","2018-02",0,"data"],[1,"The flashcards are not working Disappointed app","2015-02",0,"bug"],[1,"On Android 4.4 the app doesn't show any card. All the shapes and letters I see are fallen on each other :-/","2014-09",0,""],[1,"Why does it say insufficient storage available on my phone when I have plenty of space available on my phone?","2014-08",0,""],[1,"Free app but requires paid account. Except it is overpriced for what it offers","2014-02",0,"pay,data"],[1,"Hey guys.. What is the id n password we need to enter? Im not able to login with my gmail..Please reply.. Waiting to rate a 5* if it opens","2013-11",0,"data"],[1,"Im not able to open the app, it\"s giving wrong password though i give the correct one!!","2013-09",0,""],[1,"No way to continuously go through all the words in a set. Group of 4 to 5 words will keep on repeating even if you click on 'i knew this word'. Not at all useful for revision.","2017-03",0,"repeat"],[1,"With the new update, we are not able to see the meaning by tapping on the card. Please set it right","2017-10",0,""],[1,"What a waste of time. Everything on this is paid. Wasted my data for this....","2014-06",0,""],[2,"The app completely loses your progress and resets every once in awhile. So much for \"making a Magoosh account to save your progress\"!","2020-07",0,"data"],[2,"the ui is too bad, the buttons are overlapping the top bar of my google pixel 7. not able to access features","2026-03",0,"ui"],[2,"The create an account button does not work, after adding email and password for some reason its grayed out.","2022-10",0,"data,ui"],[2,"Kindly update app and add some relevant illustrations or other memory links so that learning becomes easier.","2022-07",0,""],[2,"Good app but still have some drawbacks like it is not providing PDF of meaning which may help better to learn fast.","2019-08",0,""],[2,"Most words are explained with an adjective instaed of definition or a synonymn which makes it confusing to learn a new word.","2022-12",0,"ui"],[2,"Please please provide offline word pronunciation,it takes so much time to pronounce it and why did you guys get Batman to pronounce the words? That batman voice is so unclear.","2020-05",0,"voice"],[2,"Advance -1 Beg - assume something is true Which is not right, please look into the problem asap.","2022-02",0,""],[2,"good app. but I lose my data quite often, to the point that it's unbearable","2025-05",0,""],[2,"Amazing application, very helpful to remember vocabularies","2024-06",0,""],[2,"When I go to sign up or log in on mobile it shows me \"server error\".","2022-02",0,"bug,data"],[2,"It has to have better website functions.","2021-11",0,""],[2,"Reset features don't work sometimes.","2020-03",0,"data"],[2,"Flashcards Dont reset","2020-06",0,"data"],[2,"Every time I am facing login error.","2022-11",0,"bug,data"],[2,"does what it's supposed to do","2026-05",0,""],[2,"Application superbe qui sauve la vie. Malheureusement les bugs la rendent inutilisables (perte constantes des données utilisateurs, répétition uniquement sur certains mots)","2025-02",0,"bug"],[2,"The new update does not allow to select and copy paste word...I use to copy 5-5 words in quizlet to remember. Please enable copy paste. Thank you. And the audio is not working in my android phone.","2017-10",0,"bug"],[2,"Recently updated version is not working properly. It is not opening the flash card meaning. And my progress from previous version is not syncing.","2017-10",0,"bug,data"],[2,"Blank page appears after clicking on the word. I need help from the team.","2017-10",0,""],[2,"By mistake if you click \" I didn't know this word\", you're done...that word will haunt you for life:/","2017-12",0,"wrong"],[2,"After tapping a card, the app is not diaplaying the meaning instead it's displaying pink screen. Please fix it","2017-10",0,"wish"],[2,"There's no testing or answer choices, just looking at a word and clicking yes I knew or no I didn't know it. Not what I was looking for","2017-02",0,""],[2,"The app didn't help me much . there are no synonyms or antonyms of the words so that someone can understand all possible meanings . I think magoosh should really look into this matter","2017-12",0,""],[2,"The app crashes frequently for my Samsung S4 lollipop version. Please look into the issue. App is great for learning and will give 5 stars if the above issue resolves.","2016-05",0,"bug"],[2,"Pros: 1) more content than any other app I've found. +3 stars. Cons: 1) Magoosh does not belong on a flash card. i'm 99.9% sure that it will NOT be on the actual test. -2 stars. 2) Word Cycling is terrible. a) I often get a word in the \"learning\" category again only 2 cards later. of course i know the answer, i just had the word 2 cards ago. if i had mastered most of the words it wouldn't be so annoying. but this is at a point of 2 words mastered, 6 reviewing, 12 learning (yeah, my vocab sucks). There are 30 more words i haven't seen yet, that could be more useful than the word i just saw 2 cards ago. - 1 star. b) with a similar completion level as part A, i will often get into loops of 5-6 words that i am reviewing. -1 Star. unfortunately its the most concise app i have found, so i guess i'll have to continue being angry with its flaws","2015-07",0,"ui"],[2,"Even on the full magoosh website, you cannot download the flashcards or even look at a complete list of them. The app is not as good as other flashcard apps. It has no flagging feature. It does not let you choose to do the cards in a random or alphabetical order. It does not show you how to pronounce the words. It is pretty much as basic as it gets. I only gave 2 stars because of the amount of flashcards. Otherwise, they definitely suck.","2015-10",0,""],[2,"It only repeats few words while practicing a deck which I have mastered. Also to reset the decks it requires internet connection. It should be a offline procedure and cards should be synced later on. Also no option for resetting a particular deck. Also we can practice only one deck at a time. We should be able to mix up decks.","2015-08",0,"data,lack,repeat"],[2,"Great app as far as content, but like someone mentioned, after you master a deck and try to review, it simply repeats the same three words.","2015-08",0,"repeat"],[2,"Plz plz plz....tell me how i can get ur older version...in which mcqs were there....m not able learn from it properly","2016-03",0,""],[2,"Gets stuck into 2-3 words while revising","2015-10",0,"bug"],[2,"This app crashes down after every 5 minutes.","2016-01",0,"bug"],[3,"Great app. Just a few suggestions that will make it better. 1. Mnemonic devices (I can't stress this enough in words) 2. Synonyms and Antonyms with tags that can lead us to that word and definition if clicked on. Thanks!!","2024-10",0,""],[3,"Very helpful app and thank you for making it free. A small suggestion: the flashcards should have spaced repetition and the answers could also have images. Refer to Fluent forever by Gabriel wyner. It's a life-chaning book for improved language learning","2023-02",0,"wish,+effect,+review,+free,+wish"],[3,"Honestly the app is nice, it helps you study a lot of words for the GRE. I however believe that it should have a better algorithm to show you new words at your own pace, like Anki does (a similar flashcard memorization app).","2025-03",0,"wish,+effect,+review,+exam,+wish"],[3,"The app was okay. It is easy to use. But I have some doubts on the words and meanings that they included. One is that there is a word that is not necessary and would probably not be in the GRE. And second, I am using the Kaplan flashcards. I saw that they both have this specific word but the meaning in this app does not make any sense to me. Because I am like this is not supposed to be the meaning of this word when I saw it in Kaplan. So I check with Google. Kaplan has the same meaning posted","2024-08",0,"+short,+review,+exam"],[3,"It's pretty handy to learn new words for the GRE. But it doesn't save your progress accurately after exiting a section, which is frustrating.","2025-02",0,"+exam"],[3,"Some feedback: please provide a sentence that uses the adjective form of \"contingent\" and correct the coding on \"derive\" so that we can't see the ><","2020-08",0,""],[3,"menu bar when using a pixel 10 xl phone is inaccessible on the top left of the interface","2026-07",0,"ui"],[3,"It would be much better if: 1. There were diagrams 2. Option of meaning in respective native language. Other this is good.","2024-03",0,""],[3,"Option for seeing all the cards in order. And also why cant there be just a single app for everything rather than installing multiple apps just to occupy my storage!","2019-04",0,""],[3,"examples are harder than words. (please synonyms and easier examples, that would be very helpful for newcomers)","2025-11",0,"+effect,+exam"],[3,"App is great but Can't see the full explanation for word s and also can't turn on the voice explanation for words","2021-06",0,""],[4,"It's very useful. It tracks the words I have learned and helps me to remember the news ones. Not always the explanation are enough, many times I have to use an online dictionary as an extra tool.","2019-10",0,"+effect"],[4,"It would have been perfect if they would have given mnemonics for the words. Please add mnemonics so that it will be really easy to remember. Otherwise, the app is good.","2019-05",0,"+effect,+short,+wish"],[4,"Helps in retaining words, if revised regularly, the new fill in the blank update is very helpful, would have given 5 stars but one thing is missing, I want deck wise option to reset as it would make revision much better.","2020-05",0,"+effect"],[4,"Very good! I would recommend adding an overview all words found within a particular section to avoid clicking through every single word to just to find the one you were looking for.","2020-08",0,""],[4,"Sign up Error There is an error, after installing this app it gives an error when I try to create an account in order to save my web progress. I think overall performance is good.","2022-03",0,""],[4,"It's a good app for building vocabulary.. although would've been better if there was an option for picking up some particular flashcards by ourselves and review them all together..","2020-04",0,"+review"],[4,"It's really easy to use and I like the review aspect of the app helped to really get use to the words and also gave brief and most easy meaning of words any one can relate to.","2021-06",0,"+effect,+short,+review"],[4,"Good app to practice vocab. Could improve by addition of multiple choice options, word association exercises, fill in the blanks and so on.","2022-08",0,"+wish"],[4,"It would be really great if we have an option to review list of words at one place as the searching of words will also become easier.","2018-09",0,"+review"],[4,"The magoosh app is so useful to use because of this much easeness i could write this review. Perfect way to teach the vocabulary. The three stars are for the vocabulary. One star extra for easeness. The last star i will give when you have a picture or pnemoniks to remember the word","2020-08",0,"+effect,+review"],[4,"Really useful app . Star marking shall be introduced for marking the difficult word in each module ,so that it will be handy during the time of revision.","2018-09",0,""],[4,"This app works smoothly and really good for learning from the beginning, but I think the interface can be modified and the synonymous can also be chosen with more easy and simple words.","2022-05",0,"+short"],[4,"Like its simple design. Keep it as free as possible so that we poor students in 3rd world countries can use it to learn advanced academic English.","2025-02",0,"+short,+free"],[4,"It doesn’t stay in sync with the website. Even if I tap the sync with website button under settings, it is still stuck in a past state.","2022-04",0,""],[4,"The flashcards are very helpful. It would be more time efficient if we could choose how many times we revisit a word before we master it","2023-08",0,"+effect,+review"],[4,"I've just started learning various words through this app..and l already like it. It repeats words and that is really helpful to remember them.","2022-10",0,"+effect"],[4,"It is fun to learn new words, as I'm trying to be a polymath. It has good descriptions and examples which makes it easy to learn and remember.","2020-07",0,"+effect,+short,+fun,+exam"],[4,"If you are from middle class student and want to improve your vocab. Then you can find this app very friendly.","2019-10",0,"+exam,+wish"],[4,"I have use the app for about a week and from my little time of experience with the app I will recommend it to new users. It is easy to use and very flexible.","2019-01",0,"+short"],[4,"App is amazing! A small suggestion, please include a place to add notes for each words.","2019-09",0,""],[4,"It would ve great if the flashcards had some synonyms and pictures to relate to, but still good, provides a lot of words","2021-09",0,"+review"],[5,"This app provides you with fascinating word lists perfect for the GRE and those want to know many useful words. Please make it available for the users to have a complete list of all the words that are provided in the app. Or at least at the end of each list after the learner covers all the words.","2019-10",0,"+exam"],[5,"The gold standard, especially for NATIVE speakers seeking to expand their vocabulary. I wish answers were in multiple choice form but that form would generate equal criticism suggesting this form so that's a personal preference not a shortcoming of the app. Recommended - lots of $5 words to confound your foes.","2022-06",0,"+short,+wish"],[5,"The simplicity, oh!, no complicated mechanics, no wierd gamification of anything. It gives me words, their definition and one sentence. It ends there, i don't have to go through a jungle of garbage for the core of the app. It's orgasmic.","2020-01",0,""],[5,"This app is quite useful, I came across this app after trying and testing many other famous app but fail miserably to a point that i thought it's impossible to learn vocab . After a cycle of kept trying and again failing, these really give me a break through I was looking for from the beginning. IF IT WORKS FOR ME, IT MIGHT AS WELL WORK FOR YOU.JUST DON'T GIVE COZ EVERYTIME You FAIL, YOU COME ONE STEP CLOSER TO ACHIEVE THE RIGHT ANSWER. KEEP GOING","2020-06",0,"+exam"],[5,"Easy to use for studying! Only through the first stack so far but it's pretty simple and clean. Not too many ads either 'cept for them promoting their own gre prep book. Need to sign in to save progress but apparently you can continue off from their website on desktop; however I haven' t tried it yet.","2019-07",0,"+short,+exam"],[5,"It is an extremely helpful app for students aspiring to go abroad. It's Handy, you can even open this app instead of playing stupid games. Pass your time by increasing ur knowledge as well. Very Very helpful app. Must install for all the GRE students as well as students who are willing to improve their English beyond excellence.","2019-03",0,"+effect,+fun,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Using this app helped me to answer most of the questions regarding the TC section of GRE. I would recommend it to new learners. Not only there is this 1000 words that you will learn, but also there would be many words in the example sections.","2025-02",0,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"Helps you undergo GRE prep on the go. Initiall, I couldn't find time separately to do vocab. With this app, I could learn new words during everyday routines and breaks. Very efficient too.","2020-09",0,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"An awesome app to start preparing nwords for GRE. It's a great app and makes learning new words fun. The only suggestion is : words appear randomly. Hence if I master 5 words on day 1 I may need to search through all 50 to find those 5 if I am trying to revise.","2018-12",0,"+fun,+exam"],[5,"Magoosh GRE flashcard are very addictive and loaded with tons of useful information that help you to get a good score on your GRE test. The app is very convenient and easy to use. Their customer service is the best.","2019-02",0,"+short,+review,+fun,+exam,+custom"],[5,"Very good for increasing reading comprehension and vocabulary section on GRE. I just wish it had a reset button for the sections a person wants practice from the beginning.","2018-10",0,"+exam,+wish"],[5,"This is an amazing app.. I suggest one simple edit.. To enable us adding our notes.. I like to add the definition in my native language to memorize the words better.. Thank you so much","2020-01",0,"+effect,+short"],[5,"Best vocabulary app I've ever used. Its method forces repetition in a natural and interesting way - it really works. No bugs, clear definitions. Five stars, hands down.","2021-11",0,"+review"],[5,"Perfect app for learning GRE voc. yet it will be great if app. will contain more words and classifications for it. For instance words which used for business.. or for medicine and etc.","2021-08",0,"+exam"],[5,"This app has been of huge help and allowed me learn, fairly abstruse, vocabulary in a matter of two weeks or so. I'd highly recommend this to anyone preparing for the gre","2019-10",0,"+exam"],[5,"One of the most comfortable and user friendly apps for learning vocabulary. Easy to track learning status. Most helpful feature is differentiating new words for later revision.","2019-04",0,"+effect,+short"],[5,"Very helpful tool accessible at the fingertip. I am a working professional with a very tight schedule so it is great to have something I can use while commuting or when I find a moment in my day.","2019-01",0,"+effect"],[5,"I'm reading vocabs from this app and till now it's the most effective one for me. I hate learning word from wordbooks with such boring presentation. Magoosh app challenges to learn step by step, yet in interesting ways.","2020-01",0,"+effect"],[5,"So far it's a really great app to build up your vocabulary in a short span of time. I would encourage the addition of mnemonics as an additional feature for the app.","2021-01",0,"+short"],[5,"To me it's a game to enrich my vocabulary. I loved the experience as it is designed to hold your attention for a long time. Each word contains a practical sentence which helps me use the words I learnt in my daily conversation.","2024-02",0,"+effect,+fun,+habit"],[5,"According to me I found this app quite suitable and good for the students who are preparing for GRE otherwise also the app is very much fine if one wants to improve their vocab.","2018-10",0,"+exam,+wish"],[5,"Great app for practicing words. A nice addition would be to have a list of all words for each section as it gets hard to track otherwise.","2021-07",0,""],[5,"So far it is a great Vocab. Learning app in my eye you can learn easily and also make yourself your own teacher I suggest all of you to look only 2 words per day so that you may master in Eng. Vocab very easily","2020-07",0,""],[5,"It has made memorizing words so easy! I'd suggest this app to anybody who has to prepare for GRE. It saves time and is super efficient!","2019-04",0,"+effect,+short,+exam"],[5,"Its really really good. I believe Everybody eho is taking up gre should have this app and use it regularly. You can access it anytime. Its absolutely brilliant and very convenient.","2019-09",0,"+short,+exam,+wish"],[5,"Amazing app! I wanted to inform you about something. In Basic VI, the meaning of the word \"Fawn\" is given as \"to gain favour through flattery\" but in the sentence it is used as showing affection like a fan of some celebrity does. Is it something that needs to be corrected?","2019-10",0,""],[5,"A great app to learn GRE words. it can add some options to take part in fill in the gap / MCQ type exam after completion of each segment.","2020-04",0,"+exam"],[5,"The flashcards really help to store the word and its meaning together as one thing, in my mind. Dividing the flashcards into small sets helps as well.","2020-06",0,"+effect,+review"],[5,"Contains the most frequently asked list of GRE vocabulary. If you're a word buff, you will really love to work on it whenever you find free times.","2018-11",0,"+exam,+free"],[5,"This is really a great app to learn words. Before using it i could only menorize words and then forget. This app provides the best strategy to keep the words in memory.","2018-10",0,"+review"],[5,"Great app to get your vocab up to date, if not only for GRE. However, having 2 or more examples would be helpful. Then again there's Google for that.","2023-06",0,"+effect,+exam"],[5,"I love the design of the app, even when you show you have known a word it still brings it back again and again for mastery purpose. If you truly want to learn new words pls download it. It will be very helpful.","2022-06",0,"+effect"],[5,"Excellent app to build vocabulary. Clean design and easy to navigate.","2026-07",0,"+short"],[5,"Really helpful. And the best thing about this app is that the words given are high frequency words which helps in memorizing the words in day to day reading.","2020-09",0,"+effect"],[5,"Fantastic. I have learnt so many words from this app. I also love the illustrations given in the course of trying to explain a word","2024-10",0,""]];